  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information Portal on Voluntary Return and Reintegration - 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The online platform (www.ReturningfromGermany.de) was launched in May 2017 to fill information gaps on assisted voluntary return and reintegration (AVRR). The project aims to support migrants in taking an informed decision on voluntary return. It also facilitates the work of AVRR counsellors. The information portal is available in ten languages and can be accessed from every desktop computer, smartphone, and tablet.</narrative>
  </description>
